    "b-sks-rc-core-intro": {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Two core objects and one join. target is what a worker can be handed: one row per workable GALE01 build-report item — a function or a data section — every column written by reconciliation, the operational root everything hangs off — status, the target ledger, the queue — in a set only a new report can change. entity is everything else worth knowing about: the mechanical kinds ("
        },
        {
          "insert": "translation_unit",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ", "
        },
        {
          "insert": "struct",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ", "
        },
        {
          "insert": "struct_field",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ", "
        },
        {
          "insert": "parameter",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ") auto-generated from the report and checkout, and the curated kinds ("
        },
        {
          "insert": "game_concept",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ", "
        },
        {
          "insert": "pattern",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ") admitted by the librarian — with nothing operational attached beyond the unit-level PR attribution exception. link joins any subject to any subject, target or entity on either side, with a role, a why, and an inline evidence pointer — a kind and locator into a knowledge source. Everything debatable about either object is fact rows on it, assembled by the knowledge-record view."
        }
      ],
      "id": "b-sks-rc-core-intro",
      "children": []
    },
    "b-sks-rc-core-objects-heading": {
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "The objects"
